@baseUrl = http://localhost:5236

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Item 14: example requests runnable directly in VS Code's "REST Client" extension
### or Rider's built-in HTTP client. Run the Api project first (`dotnet run --project
### UrlShortener.Api`), then send requests with "Send Request" above each block.
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Health -- liveness (process is up; no dependency checks)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Health -- readiness (DB-aware, via AddDbContextCheck<AppDbContext>)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Swagger UI (Development only) -- open in a browser, not sendable as a request:
### {{baseUrl}}/swagger

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Create -- valid request (201 Created)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/short-urls
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 5f8c1e2a-9b3d-4e7f-9a1c-2d6b7e4f0a11

{
  "originalUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/some/very/long/path?query=1"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Create -- missing URL (400 ValidationProblemDetails)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/short-urls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": ""
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Create -- malformed URL (400 ValidationProblemDetails)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/short-urls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "not-a-url"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Create -- disallowed scheme, e.g. javascript: (400 ValidationProblemDetails)
### See nfr-security.md §3.1 -- the classic stored-XSS-gadget vector, rejected by the
### scheme allowlist.
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/short-urls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "javascript:alert(1)"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Fetch/redirect -- replace {code} with a code returned by a Create call above
### (302 Found, Location header holds the original URL; browsers follow it
### automatically, most HTTP clients show the 302 + Location header instead).
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/{code}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Fetch/redirect -- unknown but well-formed code (404 Not Found)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/zzzzzzz

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Fetch/redirect -- malformed code, characters outside the base62 alphabet
### (item 16: 400 Bad Request, rejected before any repository/DB lookup)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/not-a-real-code!

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Correlation ID -- send your own X-Correlation-Id and see it echoed back as a
### response header and included as "traceId" in any ProblemDetails error body.
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/short-urls
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-correlation-id-123

{
  "originalUrl": "not-a-url"
}
